# The Emissary (Bastok 2-3, mission.bastok.the_emissary). A level 30 Warrior of Bastok at Port Bastok, 1-1 to 2-2
# completed by a GM (no mission current; a GM's Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1's 30035 out of the logins). Section 1
# (no current mission, a Bastokan): Argus plays his script's mission list 1001; its finish with option 0 (not 5) does
# nothing; with option 5 it begins the mission (YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION). Section 2 (2-3 current): Argus, Cleades
# (Markets), Rashid (Mines) and Malduc (Metalworks) each play their zone's ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 23. Naji at
# status 0 with no letter: 713 (the eighth parameter is 1, nothing completed; its finish gives the letter to the
# consuls and moves to status 1). Naji with the letter at status 1, with the letter at status 0 (a GM), and at status
# 1 with the letter taken (a GM): GOOD_LUCK, a message with no event. Rival zone-in, another mission's script: the
# warp into Bastok Markets plays Seekers of Adventure's Rumors from the West onZoneIn, which returns 22 (the trace
# records only that return, with no event packet).
lists BastokMarkets/Cleades/onTrigger BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/1001 BastokMines/Rashid/onTrigger BastokMines/onEventFinish/1001 Metalworks/Malduc/onTrigger Metalworks/Naji/onTrigger Metalworks/onEventFinish/713 Metalworks/onEventFinish/714 Metalworks/onEventFinish/1001 PortBastok/Argus/onTrigger PortBastok/onEventFinish/1001
char zone=PortBastok pos=132,8.5,-4 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Bastok TheZeruhnReport completed
mission Bastok GeologicalSurvey completed
mission Bastok Fetichism completed
mission Bastok TheCrystalLine completed
mission Bastok WadingBeasts completed
login
trigger Argus                           # section 1: 1001
finish option=0                         # not 5: nothing
trigger Argus                           # 1001 again
finish option=5                         # begun
trigger Argus                           # section 2
warp -358,-10,-168 BastokMarkets
trigger Cleades
warp -8.4,-1,-121 BastokMines
trigger Rashid
warp 64,-14,-4 Metalworks
trigger Malduc
trigger Naji                            # status 0, no letter: 713
finish-if-event
trigger Naji                            # the letter held: GOOD_LUCK
finish-if-event
missionstatus Bastok 0
trigger Naji                            # status 0 with the letter
finish-if-event
missionstatus Bastok 1
delkeyitem LetterToTheConsulsBastok
trigger Naji                            # status 1 without the letter
finish-if-event
